@startuml
title Gym progress: streak transitions

[*] --> NoStreak

NoStreak --> ActiveStreak : counted day\n(started: streak = 1)

ActiveStreak --> ActiveStreak : same day\n(held)
ActiveStreak --> ActiveStreak : next day\n(advanced: streak + 1)
ActiveStreak --> ActiveStreak : gap <= freezes\n(frozen: freezes -= gap, streak + gap)
ActiveStreak --> ActiveStreak : gap > freezes\n(broken: streak = 1)

note right of ActiveStreak
  "Counted day" means either the daily
  push-up target was hit or at least
  one resistance set was logged.

  A frozen transition emits
  streak.frozen.v1; a broken
  transition emits streak.broken.v1.
end note

@enduml
